  "Description": {
    "Cost": 7727335,
    "UIName": "Blood Asp",
    "Id": "chassisdef_blood_asp_BAS-F",
    "Name": "Blood Asp",
    "Details": "Introduced at the turn of the century, the Blood Asp was created by the Star Adders in anticipation of the Clans' return to the Inner Sphere. Developed during the Jihad, the F configuration is designed for close-quarters combat. Featuring four Streak SRM-6 launchers with three tons of ammunition, and a pair of Medium Pulse Lasers and AP Gauss Rifles for short range combat. For medium and long range, it mounts two ER PPCs and a single Plasma Cannon with a ton ammo. To cope with the heat buildup, the 'Mech has been given an additional five Double Heat Sinks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_bloodasp"
  },
